SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) - GS COWS (30R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\n\nRide leader: open\nAnticipated Average Pace: (14-16 m
 ph)\nRoute: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/gs-cows-30r/](https:
 //routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/gs-cows-30r/)\n\nThis is an Intermediat
 e C Class ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed.
  This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal.
  The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with occa
 sional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to align to pace 
 capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ri
 de with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by y
 ourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph 
 average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a s
 lower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water
  and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\
 nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club 
 membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does n
 ot mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lanca
 sterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is y
 our agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](ht
 tps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&mod
 ule_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https
 ://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=
 326137)
